(OP20 - S1 - ROUGH OD PROFILE - T01 CNMG 80DEG R0.8)
(D50 TO Z-125, R5 FILLET, FLANGE FACE Z-130, D100 TO Z-152)
(LEAVES 0.5 MM PER SIDE: U1.0 ON DIAMETER, W0.5 ON FACES)
G21 G18 G40 G99 (METRIC, XZ PLANE, COMP OFF, FEED PER REV)
G28 U0 W0 (MACHINE REFERENCE BEFORE TOOL CALL)
T0101 (T01 OD ROUGH)
G97 S500 M03 (CONSTANT 500 RPM)
M08 (COOLANT ON)
G00 X110.0 Z2.0 (APPROACH POINT = CYCLE START POINT)
G71 U2.5 R0.5 (RADIAL DEPTH 2.5 MM, RETRACT 0.5 MM)
G71 P100 Q150 U1.0 W0.5 F0.2 (PROFILE N100-N150, FINISH ALLOWANCE, FEED 0.2)
N100 G00 X50.0 (PROFILE START: THREAD MAJOR D50)
N110 G01 Z-125.0 (D50 TO FILLET TANGENT POINT)
N120 G02 X60.0 Z-130.0 R5.0 (CONCAVE R5 FILLET TO FLANGE RIGHT FACE)
N130 G01 X100.0 (FLANGE RIGHT FACE UP TO D100)
N140 G01 Z-152.0 (FLANGE OD D100, 2 MM PAST FLANGE LEFT FACE)
N150 G01 X106.0 (PROFILE END ABOVE STOCK D105)
G00 X110.0 Z2.0 (BACK AT APPROACH POINT)
M09 (COOLANT OFF)
G28 U0 W0 (RETURN TO REFERENCE)
M05 (SPINDLE STOP)
M30 (END OF PROGRAM)
